@title Lesson walk: emc-on-the-plate (every step, Do it for me or Next)
@area Learn
# Starts the lesson from the palette and plays each step as a learner would: an action step with Do it for me, a reading step with Next. A picture and a layout check after each step.
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text interference on the plate
wait 6
click_text "Interference on the plate: bonding and shield ends"
wait 40
shot 01-open-cabinet
check_layout
try click_text "Do it for me"
wait 30
shot 02-emc-on
check_layout
try click_text "Do it for me"
wait 30
shot 03-read-picture
check_layout
try click_text "Next"
wait 20
shot 04-bonding
check_layout
try click_text "Do it for me"
wait 30
shot 05-bond-truth
check_layout
try click_text "Next"
wait 20
shot 06-shields
check_layout
try click_text "Do it for me"
wait 30
shot 07-fix-it
check_layout
try click_text "Next"
wait 20
shot 08-leave
check_layout
try click_text "Do it for me"
wait 30
shot end
check_layout
